    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.bracketed\n\n### Description\n\nSome default mappings, like `]d`, `]b`, `]l` and `]q` are superfluous, and some override the default mappings with vastly different functionality, like the `]t` family of mappings.\nhttps://neovim.io/doc/user/vim_diff.html#default-mappings",
