        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> By \"not documented\" I meant that the _overrides_ weren't documented, not that the functions of the mappings weren't documented.\n\nIt is documented that module creates `]b` and other mappings by default, so I'd assume it is implied that setting up module will override built-in mappings (with its own RHS for the mappings). Choose different prefix to not override.\n\nThis is the case for several other modules that create mappings \"overriding\" built-in ones. Like 'mini.operators' (`gs`, `grr`), 'mini.align' (`ga`), etc.",
